{"strongs": "H3791", "word": "כְּתָב", "translit": "ka.tav", "root": "כתב", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "writing", "definition": "כְּתָב noun masculine Ezra 4:7 writing (late Aramaic; Biblical Aramaic כְּתָב Syriac ); — ׳ כ absolute 1Chr 28:19 + 4 t.; construct Ezek 13:9 + 4 t.; suffix כְּתָבָהּ Esth 1:22 + 2 t.; כְּתָבָם Ezra 2:62 + 3 t.; — writing: 1. register, enrolement , Ezek 13:9 ; Ezra 2:62 = Neh 7:64 . 2. = mode of writing, character, letter , הִנִּשְׁתְּוָן כָּתוּב אֲרָמִית ׳ וּכ Ezra 4:7 and the writing of the letter was written in Aramaic (characters; so probably, see BeRy Ryle, compare Late Hebrew Hoffm ZAW i.(1881), 334 ff. ); compare Esth 1:22 ; Esth 3:12 ; Esth 8:9 (twice in verse). 3. = letter , 2Chr 2:10 ; Esth 9:27 . 4. of a royal enactment, edict 2Chr 35:4 (|| מִכְתָּב ), Esth 3:14 ; Esth 8:8 ; Esth 8:13 more fully כְּתָבהַֿדָּת Esth 4:8 . 5. of a writing with divine authority 1Chr 28:19 אֱמֶת ׳ כ Dan 10:21 , i.e. a book of truth.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4240')\">BDB4240</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3791')\">H3791</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4239')\">BDB4239</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB4241')\">BDB4241</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>כְּתָב</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b><sup><ref ref=\"Ezra 4:7\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,7)\">Ezra 4:7</ref></sup> <highlightword>writing</highlightword> (late Aramaic; Biblical Aramaic <bdbarc>כְּתָב</bdbarc> Syriac <placeholder2683/>); — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> absolute <ref ref=\"1Chr 28:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,28,19)\">1Chr 28:19</ref> + 4 t.; construct <ref ref=\"Ezek 13:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,13,9)\">Ezek 13:9</ref> + 4 t.; suffix <bdbheb>כְּתָבָהּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 1:22\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,22)\">Esth 1:22</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>כְּתָבָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:62\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"62\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"62\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,62)\">Ezra 2:62</ref> + 3 t.; — <highlight>writing:</highlight> <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>register, enrolement</highlight>, <ref ref=\"Ezek 13:9\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(26,13,9)\">Ezek 13:9</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezra 2:62\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"62\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"62\" onclick=\"bcv(15,2,62)\">Ezra 2:62</ref> = <ref ref=\"Neh 7:64\" b=\"16\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"64\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"64\" onclick=\"bcv(16,7,64)\">Neh 7:64</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> = <highlight>mode of writing, character, letter</highlight>, <bdbheb>הִנִּשְׁתְּוָן כָּתוּב אֲרָמִית</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>וּכ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezra 4:7\" b=\"15\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(15,4,7)\">Ezra 4:7</ref> <highlight>and the writing of the letter was written in Aramaic</highlight> (characters; so probably, see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Be')\">BeRy</lookup> Ryle, compare Late Hebrew <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hoffm')\">Hoffm<sup>ZAW i.(1881), 334 ff.</sup></lookup>); compare <ref ref=\"Esth 1:22\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(17,1,22)\">Esth 1:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 3:12\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(17,3,12)\">Esth 3:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:9\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,9)\">Esth 8:9</ref> (twice in verse). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> = <highlight>letter</highlight>, <ref ref=\"2Chr 2:10\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(14,2,10)\">2Chr 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 9:27\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(17,9,27)\">Esth 9:27</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> of a royal enactment, edict <ref ref=\"2Chr 35:4\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(14,35,4)\">2Chr 35:4</ref> (|| <bdbheb>מִכְתָּב</bdbheb>), <ref ref=\"Esth 3:14\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(17,3,14)\">Esth 3:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,8)\">Esth 8:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Esth 8:13\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(17,8,13)\">Esth 8:13</ref> more fully <bdbheb>כְּתָבהַֿדָּת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Esth 4:8\" b=\"17\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(17,4,8)\">Esth 4:8</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>5.</b> of a writing with divine authority <ref ref=\"1Chr 28:19\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"28\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"28\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(13,28,19)\">1Chr 28:19</ref> <bdbheb>אֱמֶת</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>כ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Dan 10:21\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(27,10,21)\">Dan 10:21</ref>, i.e. a book of truth. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Ezra 4:7", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 4, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "1Chr 28:19", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 28, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Ezek 13:9", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 13, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "Esth 1:22", "book": "EST", "chapter": 1, "verse": 22}, {"raw": "Ezra 2:62", "book": "EZR", "chapter": 2, "verse": 62}, {"raw": "Neh 7:64", "book": "NEH", "chapter": 7, "verse": 64}, {"raw": "Esth 3:12", "book": "EST", "chapter": 3, "verse": 12}, {"raw": "Esth 8:9", "book": "EST", "chapter": 8, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "2Chr 2:10", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 2, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Esth 9:27", "book": "EST", "chapter": 9, "verse": 27}, {"raw": "2Chr 35:4", "book": "2CH", "chapter": 35, "verse": 4}, {"raw": "Esth 3:14", "book": "EST", "chapter": 3, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Esth 8:8", "book": "EST", "chapter": 8, "verse": 8}, {"raw"